OL,3,GNEWSACouple's 600-day detention should
OL,4,Ashock people, son says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe detention of a couple held in Iran
OL,7,F"should shock people" as their time
OL,8,Fbeing held reaches over 600 days, their
OL,9,Ffamily says.
OL,11,FFamily of Craig and Lindsay Foreman say
OL,12,Fthe wait for the couple to be returned
OL,13,Fhas been "an incredibly long time",
OL,14,Fafter they were detained while on a
OL,15,Fmotorbiking trip in Iran in January
OL,16,F2025.
OL,18,FThe couple, from East Sussex, were
OL,19,Fsentenced to 10 years in jail over
OL,20,Fespionage charges, which they both
OL,21,Fdeny, and are continuing to be held in
OL,22,FEvin prison.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
