OL,3,GNEWSACouple's 600-day detention should
OL,4,Ashock people, son says
OL,5,
OL,6,FLindsay's son, Joe Bennett, from
OL,7,FFolkestone in Kent, said: "We are
OL,8,Fconstantly knocking on every door
OL,9,Favailable to us."
